WEBVTT

00:20:59.572 --> 00:21:03.509
att varje liv, varje enskilt liv,

00:21:03.509 --> 00:21:06.444
är oändligt betydelsefullt.

00:21:06.444 --> 00:21:08.305
Tack så mycket.

00:21:08.305 --> 00:21:10.705
(Applåder)

00:21:10.705 --> 00:21:13.713
Tack. Tack.

00:21:13.713 --> 00:21:16.689
(Applåder)

00:21:17.079 --> 00:21:18.881
Tack.

00:21:18.881 --> 00:21:21.855
(Applåder)